@startuml
title Doctor Functional/Compositional Flow
start
:collect_environment_state();
:select_checks(common + platform);

repeat
  :run_check(state) -> DiagnosticResult;
repeat while (checks remaining?) is (yes)

:aggregate_results() -> DiagnosticReport;
if (json mode?) then (yes)
  :render_json(report);
else (no)
  :render_text(report);
endif
:map_exit_code(report);
stop

note right
Core is compositional:
independent checks + pure transforms
where possible.
end note
@enduml
